# Web / Dashboard

- Follow `.cursorrules/ui.md` and `.cursorrules/stack.md` (web section).
- App Router + TypeScript; Server Components by default.
- Features: job feed, job drawer (Draft Pitch → then copy cover/email/DM), asset URL manager.
- `generated_*` are NULL until Draft Pitch. Trigger Stage 2 via Route Handler / n8n — never invent pitch text in the browser.
- Read `web/AGENTS.md` before using unfamiliar Next APIs (Next 16 may differ from training data).
- Optional HTTP endpoints: `web/app/api/**/route.ts`. Prefer Supabase for data access.
- No scrape or Stage 1 scoring logic inside the Next app UI.
